    "Allergies are health data. ToHuus stores them encrypted in your household and only uses them for warnings on recipes. They only go to the assistant if you allow that in the settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allergies are health data. ToHuus stores them encrypted in your household and only uses them for warnings on recipes. They only go to the assistant if you allow that in the settings."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allergien sind Gesundheitsdaten. ToHuus speichert sie verschlüsselt in eurem Haushalt und nutzt sie nur für Warnhinweise bei Rezepten. An den Assistenten gehen sie nur, wenn ihr das in den Einstellungen erlaubt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
