    "Subscriptions renew automatically at the end of each period unless you cancel at least 24 hours before. The amount is charged to your Apple Account. You can manage and cancel your subscription any time in your Apple Account settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
