            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vorwoche"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These stay visible in the lists, greyed out, and are summed separately. Products and stock are not changed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These stay visible in the lists, greyed out, and are summed separately. Products and stock are not changed."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sie bleiben ausgegraut in den Listen sichtbar und werden getrennt summiert. Produkte und Bestand bleiben unverändert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These switches apply to the whole household (only admins can change them). Personal switches come with the next server update.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These switches apply to the whole household (only admins can change them). Personal switches come with the next server update."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Schalter gelten für den ganzen Haushalt (nur Admins können sie ändern). Eigene Schalter kommen mit dem nächsten Server-Update."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They get a personal link and choose how to sign in themselves – passkey, password or e-mail link. The link works once and for %d days.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "They get a personal link and choose how to sign in themselves – passkey, password or e-mail link. The link works once and for %d days."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Person bekommt einen persönlichen Link und sucht sich selbst aus, wie sie sich anmeldet – Passkey, Passwort oder E-Mail-Link. Der Link funktioniert einmal und %d Tage lang."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Things you asked ToHuus to remember – for example “we don’t eat pork” or “Mira shops on Saturdays”. Delete anything at any time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Things you asked ToHuus to remember – for example “we don’t eat pork” or “Mira shops on Saturdays”. Delete anything at any time."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was ToHuus sich für euch merken soll – zum Beispiel „Wir essen kein Schwein“ oder „Mira kauft samstags ein“. Du kannst alles jederzeit löschen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code is unknown. Give it a name and ToHuus will recognise it next time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
